  "nav.mobileAppDetail": "Android APK · releasing soon",
  "nav.mobileAppSpotlight": "Live listings, deal scores, price alerts and plate scanning — the Android APK is in final build.",
  "mobile.ctaBody": "Meanwhile the full Motormila terminal — market, trends, EV hub and pricing — is already live.",
  "mobile.ctaMarket": "Open the market",
  "mobile.ctaPricing": "See Pro plans",
  "mobile.ctaTitle": "Come back when the APK lands.",
  "mobile.downloadNote": "There is no APK to download yet — the download will appear on this page with a published checksum when the release is ready. Motormila on the web is fully live today.",
  "mobile.eyebrow": "Motormila Mobile",
  "mobile.faq.access.a": "Join the launch list above. Closed beta invites go out first, then the public APK download opens on this page.",
  "mobile.faq.access.q": "How do I get it when it lands?",
  "mobile.faq.cost.a": "Yes. Browsing, search, watchlists and price alerts stay free. Pro tools — lane intelligence, exports and deep history — carry over from your existing Motormila plan.",
  "mobile.faq.cost.q": "Will the app be free?",
  "mobile.faq.install.a": "The APK will be signed by Motormila and shipped with a SHA-256 checksum you can verify. We will never ask you to install it from a third-party mirror.",
  "mobile.faq.install.q": "Is sideloading the APK safe?",
  "mobile.faq.ios.a": "Android ships first because it covers the widest set of devices in Sri Lanka. iOS follows after the Android release is stable.",
  "mobile.faq.ios.q": "What about iPhone?",
  "mobile.faq.web.a": "No. Motormila on the web stays the full terminal — the app is the fast, offline-friendly companion for when you're out looking at cars.",
  "mobile.faq.web.q": "Does the app replace the website?",
  "mobile.faqBody": "Anything missing? Tell us inside the app's feedback panel once you're in the beta — or from the website footer today.",
  "mobile.faqEyebrow": "Questions",
  "mobile.faqTitle": "Before you ask.",
  "mobile.feature.alerts.body": "Save a car or a search and get a push notification the moment a seller cuts the price or a new match lands.",
  "mobile.feature.alerts.title": "Price-drop alerts",
  "mobile.feature.import.body": "Landed cost with CID, excise, VAT and SSCL, plus a full cost-to-own breakdown before you commit.",
  "mobile.feature.import.title": "Import & running costs",
  "mobile.feature.live.body": "Every scraped listing from Sri Lanka's big marketplaces — filter by make, district, fuel, year and price in two taps.",
  "mobile.feature.live.title": "The whole live market",
  "mobile.feature.map.body": "See where prices are moving, which districts have the deepest inventory, and where the nearest chargers are.",
  "mobile.feature.map.title": "District & EV hubs",
  "mobile.feature.offline.body": "Your watchlist, alerts and the last market snapshot are cached on the device — useful at a yard with bad coverage.",
  "mobile.feature.offline.title": "Works without signal",
  "mobile.feature.scan.body": "Point the camera at a plate and Motormila reads it on-device, then pulls the market record for that vehicle.",
  "mobile.feature.scan.title": "Scan a number plate",
  "mobile.feature.score.body": "Each listing is graded against its district median, so you know it's a good price before you call the seller.",
  "mobile.feature.score.title": "Deal scores on every car",
